__mtLangPack('zh','haw',{"A <b>kahuna pule</b>, a priest, will perform the ceremony of absolution. Then Kekoa may go home in peace. What should he do now?":"一位 <b>kahuna pule</b>（祭司）将主持赦免仪式。之后 Kekoa 就可以安心回家了。他现在该怎么做？","A band plays a guitar and an ʻukulele, and sings.":"一支乐队弹着吉他和 ʻukulele，边弹边唱。","A drone, for a view from above":"一架无人机，从空中俯瞰","A flash blinds the dancers, and talk covers the chant.":"闪光灯晃到了舞者的眼睛，说话声盖过了吟唱。","A fountain of fire, {A} / 3.":"一道火焰喷泉，{A} / 3。","A hat":"一顶帽子","A place of refuge, where a kapu-breaker could be absolved":"一个避难所，触犯 kapu 的人可以在那里获得赦免","A royal fish market":"一个王室鱼市","A surf school":"一所冲浪学校","A visitor wants to climb over the rail, to get closer for a better photo. What do you say?":"一位游客想翻过栏杆，靠近一点拍张更好的照片。你会怎么说？","A warm jacket: the rim is at {#1} m, cold before dawn":"一件保暖外套：火山口边缘海拔 {#1} m，黎明前很冷","An empty bag, to bring back a lava stone":"一个空袋子，用来带回一块熔岩石","At <b>Kīlauea Overlook</b>, behind the rail, the crater glows. An episode begins. <b>Take a photo when the fountain is at its highest</b>: three good photos.":"在<b>基拉韦厄观景台</b>，栏杆后面，火山口正发着红光。一个喷发阶段开始了。<b>在喷泉喷到最高时拍照</b>：拍三张好照片。","Between two hālau, a friend wants to film the next one with the flash on, and talk through it. What do you say?":"两个 hālau 表演之间，一位朋友想开着闪光灯拍下一个表演，还边拍边说话。你会怎么说？","Both are modern":"两者都是现代风格","Drones are not allowed in the national park.":"国家公园内禁止使用无人机。","Fine, everyone films":"好吧，大家都拍","From Kīlauea Overlook and the Crater Rim Trail":"从基拉韦厄观景台和火山口边缘步道","From a helicopter that lands on the rim":"从降落在火山口边缘的直升机上","Glasses, against the ash":"一副眼镜，防火山灰","Go on, just for a minute":"去吧，就一分钟","He reaches the shore of the puʻuhonua. Here, he is safe.":"他游到了 puʻuhonua 的岸边。在这里，他安全了。","Hide in the forest":"躲进森林","Hilo, the week after Easter: the <b>Merrie Monarch Festival</b>, named for King David Kalākaua, “the Merrie Monarch”, who brought hula back to his court. Since {#1} the hālau, the hula schools, compete here: Friday night in <b>kahiko</b>, the ancient style, Saturday night in <b>ʻauana</b>, the modern style. You are in the stands. A hālau comes on stage.":"Hilo，复活节后的那一周：<b>Merrie Monarch 节</b>，以国王 David Kalākaua 命名——他人称“Merrie Monarch”（欢乐君主），曾让 hula 重回宫廷。自 {#1} 年起，各个 hālau（hula 学校）在这里比赛：周五晚上比 <b>kahiko</b>（古老风格），周六晚上比 <b>ʻauana</b>（现代风格）。你坐在看台上。一个 hālau 登上了舞台。","Hōnaunau, long ago. In old Hawaiʻi the <b>kapu</b>, sacred laws, ruled everything: a commoner could not let his shadow fall on the chief's grounds, nor walk in his footsteps. Breaking a kapu could mean death. A young fisherman, Kekoa, has let his shadow fall on the royal grounds. Where can he go?":"很久以前的 Hōnaunau。在古代 Hawaiʻi，<b>kapu</b>（神圣的律法）支配着一切：平民不能让自己的影子落在酋长的领地上，也不能踩着他的脚印走。触犯 kapu 可能意味着死亡。年轻的渔夫 Kekoa 让自己的影子落在了王室领地上。他能去哪里？","Kahiko":"Kahiko","Kahiko: the chant and the old instruments, skirts of ti leaves or kapa.":"Kahiko：吟唱与古老的乐器，用朱蕉（ti）叶或 kapa 做的裙子。","Kīlauea has been erupting at its summit since December {#1}, in <b>episodes</b>: for a few hours, lava fountains rise from the crater of <b>Halemaʻumaʻu</b>, then it rests. The park says the best time to watch is before sunrise. <b>Pack your bag</b>: choose the three right things.":"自 {#1} 年 12 月起，Kīlauea 的山顶一直在以一个个<b>喷发阶段</b>的形式喷发：几个小时里，熔岩喷泉从 <b>Halemaʻumaʻu</b> 火山口喷涌而出，然后火山休息。公园表示，最佳观赏时间是日出之前。<b>收拾你的背包</b>：选出三样正确的东西。","Lava stones stay where they are: they belong to the place, and to Pele.":"熔岩石要留在原地：它们属于这个地方，也属于 Pele。","Leave at once, before anyone sees him":"趁没人看见，马上离开","Listen to the instruments: gourd and drum with a chant are the old style; guitars and songs are the modern one.":"听听乐器：葫芦和鼓配上吟唱是古老风格；吉他和歌曲是现代风格。","Long strokes: rushing wastes your breath.":"长长地划水：着急只会白白耗费你的气力。","Never: the floor is molten rock and poisonous gas.":"绝对不行：火山口底部是熔融的岩石和有毒气体。","No flash, no talking: watch, and applaud at the end":"不开闪光灯，不说话：静静观看，结束时再鼓掌","No landing on the rim.":"火山口边缘不允许降落。","No: kahiko is the old style.":"不对：kahiko 才是古老风格。","On the floor of the crater":"在火山口底部","Ready. Glasses and a hat against the ash, and warm clothes for the cold rim.":"准备好了。眼镜和帽子防火山灰，保暖衣物应对寒冷的火山口边缘。","Sit on the Great Wall for a photo":"坐在大石墙上拍张照","Stay behind the rail: the cliff edges crumble, and the closed areas are closed for a reason":"待在栏杆后面：悬崖边缘会崩塌，关闭的区域关闭是有原因的","Stay on the trail, and watch the honu of Keoneʻele cove from {#1} m":"走在步道上，在 {#1} m 外观看 Keoneʻele 小海湾的 honu","Surfing was a royal sport, but not here.":"冲浪曾是王室运动，但不在这里。","Swim across the bay to the puʻuhonua, the place of refuge":"游过海湾，到达 puʻuhonua 避难所","The crater is resting. Wait for the next fountain.":"火山口正在休息。等待下一次喷泉。","The fishponds were nearby, but no.":"鱼塘就在附近，但不对。","The kiʻi are not to be touched: they guard the place.":"kiʻi 不能触摸：它们守护着这个地方。","The rim can give way, and the gases are dangerous: never past the rail.":"火山口边缘可能坍塌，气体也很危险：绝不要越过栏杆。","The walls are fragile and sacred: never climb or sit on them.":"石墙脆弱而神圣：绝不要攀爬或坐在上面。","Today the puʻuhonua is a national historical park. The <b>Great Wall</b>, built about {#1}, runs {#2} m, its lava stones fitted without mortar; <b>Hale o Keawe</b>, about {#3}, held the bones of {#4} aliʻi, guarded by <b>kiʻi</b>. The kapu system ended in {#5}. On your visit, which is right?":"如今，puʻuhonua 是一座国家历史公园。<b>大石墙</b>约建于 {#1} 年，长 {#2} m，熔岩石块之间没有使用灰浆；<b>Hale o Keawe</b> 约建于 {#3} 年，曾安放着 {#4} 位 aliʻi 的遗骨，由 <b>kiʻi</b> 守护。kapu 制度于 {#5} 年终结。参观时，哪种做法是对的？","Torches on the shore behind him. <b>Swim</b>: tap in a steady rhythm, long strokes, to reach the other side.":"他身后的岸上亮起了火把。<b>游泳</b>：有节奏地点击，长长地划水，游到对岸。","Touch a kiʻi for luck":"摸一摸 kiʻi 求好运","Wait for the ceremony of the kahuna pule, then go home":"等待 kahuna pule 的仪式，然后回家","Wait: it is still rising.":"等等：它还在上升。","What was a puʻuhonua?":"puʻuhonua 是什么？","Where do visitors watch the eruption of Kīlauea?":"游客在哪里观看 Kīlauea 的喷发？","Which style of hula is the ancient one?":"哪种 hula 风格是古老的？","Without the ceremony he would still be a kapu-breaker outside the walls.":"没有仪式，他仍然是一个被挡在墙外的 kapu 触犯者。","Yes. A hula tells a story that the hālau has worked on for months: it is received in silence.":"对。一段 hula 讲述的是 hālau 排练了好几个月的故事：要在安静中欣赏。","Yes. Absolved, he could return to his family without fear.":"对。获得赦免后，他就可以毫无畏惧地回到家人身边。","Yes. Keoneʻele was the royal canoe landing; the turtles rest there today.":"对。Keoneʻele 曾是王室独木舟登岸处；如今海龟在那里休息。","Yes. The view from the overlook is the one the park keeps safe for everyone.":"对。观景台的视野正是公园为每个人保障安全的那一处。","Yes: chant, ipu heke and pahu. ʻAuana, the modern style, came with Western instruments.":"对：吟唱、ipu heke 和 pahu。ʻAuana（现代风格）随西方乐器而来。","Yes: defeated warriors and those who could not fight found safety there too.":"对：战败的武士和无法作战的人也能在那里得到庇护。","Yes: from the rim, behind the rail, best before sunrise.":"对：从火山口边缘、栏杆后面观看，最好是在日出之前。","Yes: inside the puʻuhonua, no blood could be shed.":"对：在 puʻuhonua 里，不得流血。","You swam across Hōnaunau Bay with Kekoa to the puʻuhonua, waited for the kahuna pule, and visited the place today the right way: on the trail, far from the walls and the kiʻi, the honu watched from a distance.":"你和 Kekoa 一起游过了 Hōnaunau 湾，到达 puʻuhonua，等待 kahuna pule，又以正确的方式参观了今天的这个地方：走在步道上，远离石墙和 kiʻi，远远地观看 honu。","You watched an episode of Kīlauea from the rim of Halemaʻumaʻu before dawn, with glasses and a hat against the ash, behind the rail, and left the lava stones where they belong.":"黎明前，你在 Halemaʻumaʻu 的火山口边缘观看了 Kīlauea 的一个喷发阶段，戴着眼镜和帽子防火山灰，待在栏杆后面，并把熔岩石留在了它们该在的地方。","You watched the Merrie Monarch Festival in Hilo from the stands and told kahiko from ʻauana by the instruments and the costumes ({A} hālau of 4 at the first try), in silence during the hula.":"你在 Hilo 的看台上观看了 Merrie Monarch 节，凭乐器和服装分辨出了 kahiko 和 ʻauana（第一次尝试就认对了 4 个 hālau 中的 {A} 个），并在 hula 表演时保持安静。","ʻAuana":"ʻAuana","ʻAuana is the modern style, with guitars and songs.":"ʻAuana 是现代风格，有吉他和歌曲。","ʻAuana: Western instruments, songs, flowing dresses.":"ʻAuana：西方乐器、歌曲、飘逸的长裙。","Hālau {#1} of 4.":"第 {#1} 个 hālau，共 4 个。","Which style is it?":"这是哪种风格？","A chanter beats an <b>ipu heke</b>, a double gourd, and chants.":"一位吟唱者敲着 <b>ipu heke</b>（双葫芦），边敲边吟唱。","A drummer beats a <b>pahu</b>, a drum covered with sharkskin, and chants.":"一位鼓手敲着 <b>pahu</b>（蒙着鲨鱼皮的鼓），边敲边吟唱。","A band plays a <b>steel guitar</b>, a Hawaiian invention of the {#1}s, and a guitar, and sings.":"一支乐队弹着<b>钢棒吉他</b>（{#1}年代的夏威夷发明）和一把吉他，边弹边唱。"});
